UsmRegistry::removeUsm(address)
├── given caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── given caller is owner
│   ├── when USM is zero address
│   │   └── it should revert with UsmRegistryZeroAddress
│   ├── when USM is not registered
│   │   └── it should revert with UsmRegistryUsmDoesNotExist
│   └── when USM is registered
│       ├── it should remove USM from the list
│       ├── it should emit UsmRemoved(usm)
│       └── it should make isUsm(usm) return false
